    </div>
</div>
</div>



<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
<div style="width: 50%; margin: 0 auto;">
    <div style="position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden; max-width: 100%; height: auto;">
        <iframe src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/w4gb2eb0i2g" title="Ghana 4 - 20250205 080611" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen style="position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;"></iframe>
    </div>
</div>
</div>
</div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">After some further work in the school, we are almost there, the students brought in some chairs and the teachers brought in some banners, it’s starting to look finished.</p>



<div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-3a88641f wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><div class="wp-block-image">
<figure class="aligncenter size-large"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1024" height="768" src="https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Journal_14-1024x768.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-5705" srcset="https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Journal_14-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Journal_14-300x225.jpg 300w, https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Journal_14-768x576.jpg 768w, https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Journal_14-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Journal_14.jpg 2000w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></figure>
</div></div>



<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><div class="wp-block-image">
<figure class="aligncenter size-large"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1024" height="577" src="https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Journal_15-1024x577.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-5706" srcset="https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Journal_15-1024x577.jpg 1024w, https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Journal_15-300x169.jpg 300w, https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Journal_15-768x432.jpg 768w, https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Journal_15-1536x865.jpg 1536w, https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Journal_15.jpg 2000w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></figure>
</div></div>
</div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Next, we jetted back to the other school with our driver Albert, we were there in no time to find Laurence had pulled a blinder and had all the Thin clients and monitors on desks! Great effort and a huge relief.</p>


<div class="wp-block-image">
<figure class="aligncenter size-large"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1024" height="576" src="https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Journal_16-1024x576.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-5707" srcset="https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Journal_16-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Journal_16-300x169.jpg 300w, https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Journal_16-768x432.jpg 768w, https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Journal_16-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/Journal_16.jpg 2048w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></figure>
</div>


<p class="wp-block-paragraph">After some time spent configuring the server, switches and access points in the computer room we were making good time.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The teacher who had been working with Sun Screen IT trying to get an IT lab at his school was Daniel Okeyre. His colleague Joseph another teacher is also shown in this picture, both will be teaching IT and managing the environment going forward. Two exceptional teachers.</p>


<div class="wp-block-image">
<figure class="aligncenter size-large"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1024" height="768" src="https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Journal_17-1024x768.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-5710" srcset="https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Journal_17-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Journal_17-300x225.jpg 300w, https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Journal_17-768x576.jpg 768w, https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Journal_17-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Journal_17.jpg 2000w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></figure>
</div>


<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Some of the students at this school were desperate to be introduced to the Obroni, Daniel told one of them to just come over and talk to me. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Here I met 14yr old Felicia, a strong character in herself, super bright and inquisitive, we spoke briefly about her family, she has a 1yr old baby sister, an older sister in another village called Essos and a 4yr old brother called Godwin who was at the same school. Felicia told me she likes science and wants to do medicine and become a doctor. She excused herself and re-appeared after a couple of minutes with her brother Godwin who was a little shy, but I managed to get him talking and he told me Felicia is a good sister. Unfortunately, I did not manage to get a photo with them as they had to shoot back to class. Another couple of children I won’t forget speaking with, so much life and enthusiasm, it’s heartwarming to see.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Tonight, we escaped to a local bar owned by Mr Darko, we got to see and hear about the local drinks, expertly explained by Ben. No samples of the local stuff, none of us dared to try them.</p>



<div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-3a88641f wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><div class="wp-block-image">
<figure class="aligncenter size-full"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="2000" height="1500" src="https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Journal_39.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-5810" srcset="https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Journal_39.jpg 2000w, https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Journal_39-300x225.jpg 300w, https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Journal_39-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Journal_39-768x576.jpg 768w, https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Journal_39-1536x1152.jpg 1536w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 2000px) 100vw, 2000px" /></figure>
</div></div>



<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="2000" height="1500" src="https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Journal_40.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-5811" srcset="https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Journal_40.jpg 2000w, https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Journal_40-300x225.jpg 300w, https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Journal_40-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Journal_40-768x576.jpg 768w, https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Journal_40-1536x1152.jpg 1536w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 2000px) 100vw, 2000px" /></figure>
</div>
</div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Afterwards Ben was kind enough to invite us to his house to meet his family. We also met his landlord who used to be a mariner who spent time in Russia. When questioned on where he prefers to be Russia or Ghana, he laughed and said it’s not really a question. He conversed in English and was happy to answer our “stupid questions” as he had plenty of “stupid answers”. A very interesting funny chap.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We headed back to the hotel to regroup, refuel with some “Hot Shito” and get ready for the next day. Shito, is a chilli sauce that works with the majority of African dishes, it came with every meal and provided hours of entertainment throughout the week with every pun imaginable.</p>



<div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-3a88641f wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow"><div class="wp-block-image">
<figure class="aligncenter size-full"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="400" height="400" src="https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Journal_18.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-5712" srcset="https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Journal_18.jpg 400w, https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Journal_18-300x300.jpg 300w, https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Journal_18-150x150.jpg 150w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px" /></figure>
</div></div>



<div class="wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow">
<figure class="wp-block-image size-full"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="960" height="960" src="https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Journal_19.jpg" alt="" class="wp-image-5713" srcset="https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Journal_19.jpg 960w, https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Journal_19-300x300.jpg 300w, https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Journal_19-150x150.jpg 150w, https://workspace-it.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/Journal_19-768x768.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 960px) 100vw, 960px" /></figure>
</div>
</div>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The joy of the evening shower when the water pressure was up – relief after 3 days of dribbling water pressure.</p>



<h6 class="wp-block-heading">Thursday 6<sup>th</sup> February – It’s all coming together!</h6>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Another split operation today, Nathaniel and Laurence headed back out to Accra to pickup a few more bits we needed to finish up physically. An exciting day of rejecting “Papaya” for lunch until finally realising it was Chicken from a shop call Papaya! Who would have guessed?!</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">A visit to Agbogbloshie before heading home provided some video and photographic evidence of why Sun Screen IT Foundation exists and why the world should take note and start making a change to stop E-Waste. Checkout some of what was seen:</p>



<div class="wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-3a88641f wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex">
